post.description:
Look a reference without DOI or arXiv ID up on Crossref; taken only
if the match is certain (its first author, and its title or year,
volume and page, in the reference), else 422.

get.description:
Pairs of papers that look like the same paper (same identifier or
file first, then the same title), with a recommendation which to keep;
pairs marked as different are left out.
